WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.880
When reading recursion identify the anchor first
Then identify

00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:11.433
the self-reference The join condition defines how
one level connects to

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:17.152
the next Adding a depth or path column can make the
traversal much easier

00:00:17.179 --> 00:00:22.704
to inspect and debug Do not try to understand the
whole recursive

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.796
statement at once
